+	  MT7668 SDIO combo chip, as Amazon ships it on the MT8516 Echos and
+	  lidar-mainline ported it to mainline. Bluetooth on the same chip
+	  is btmtksdio.
+
+	  Its firmware (WIFI_RAM_CODE_MT7668.bin, WIFI_RAM_CODE2_SDIO_MT7668.bin
+	  and the ROM patch) is loaded when the SDIO function is bound.
